0..79 Comment "/// The `nixpkgs` attribute `hello`, as `nix eval --json` prints its `meta` and"
80..131 Comment "/// `outputs`, read into a record type and a value."
132..135 Comment "///"
136..212 Comment "/// The Nix type provider reads an attribute of the local `nixpkgs` checkout"
213..293 Comment "/// into a record type the checker admits. No check-time site performs that read"
294..355 Comment "/// yet, so this source states the provider\'s answer by hand."
356..359 Comment "///"
360..437 Comment "/// `nix/hello.meta.json` and `nix/hello.outputs.json` are the reads\' JSON at"
438..514 Comment "/// `nixpkgs` revision `3ec636362e18`. The meta keeps the fields a package\'s"
515..588 Comment "/// description and its platforms need, and drops the maintainers and the"
589..666 Comment "/// positions in the checkout. It keeps the first twelve of the 79 platforms,"
667..728 Comment "/// since the printer spells a value at most 32 formers deep."
729..732 Comment "///"
733..749 Comment "/// - see: #2763"
750..766 Comment "/// - see: #2991"
767..820 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/package/nix/hello.meta.json`"
821..875 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/package/nix-derivation.gandr`"
